  meanings
    entry
      definitions
        entry
          definition "Metagame; the most effective tactics and strategies used in a competitive video game."
      partOfSpeech noun
    entry
      definitions
        entry
          definition "Prominent in the metagame; effective and frequently used in competitive gameplay."
          example "I don't think the character will be meta even with the recent buffs."
      partOfSpeech adjective
